        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yehoyada ashinga isezerano hagati y’Uhoraho n’umwami n’abantu, ngo babe abantu b’ Uhoraho; ashinga isezerano no hagati y’umwami n’abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
