              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajana ba bagabisha bagaba amajana na ba Bakariti na ba bashibamyi n’abantu bose bo mu gihugu; basohokana umwami mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, baramumanukana, bajana inzira ica mu kirimba c’abashibamyi, bamushikana mu ngoro i bgami. Bashitse, umwami avyagira ku ntebe y’ubgami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
